flowchart TD
  UserRequest --> Orchestrator
  Orchestrator --> Researcher
  Researcher -->|writes research.md| Planner
  Planner -->|writes implementation-plan.md| CritiqueGate{"Critique Gate\n(LLM, cross-vendor)"}
  CritiqueGate -->|APPROVED| Implementer
  CritiqueGate -->|BLOCKED| Planner

  subgraph IMPL[implementing-feature]
    Code[Write production code] --> StyleGate1["style-gate\nlint + greps\n(deterministic, ZERO tokens)"]
    StyleGate1 -->|FAIL| UserFix1{"User decides:\nfix or skip?"}
    UserFix1 -->|fix| Code
    StyleGate1 -->|PASS| UserApprove1{"User approves?"}
    UserApprove1 -->|no| Code
  end

  UserApprove1 -->|yes| Tester

  subgraph TEST[testing-implementation]
    Tests[Write tests] --> StyleGate2["style-gate\ntests + lint\n(deterministic, ZERO tokens)"]
    StyleGate2 -->|FAIL| UserFix2{"User decides:\nfix or skip?"}
    UserFix2 -->|fix| Tests
    StyleGate2 -->|PASS| UserApprove2{"User approves?"}
    UserApprove2 -->|no| Tests
  end

  UserApprove2 -->|yes| Reviewer

  subgraph REVIEW[reviewing-code]
    LoadRules[Load rules/*.md + cognition lessons] --> LoadDiff[Read git diff]
    LoadDiff --> LLMJudge["Single LLM review\n(UNIQUE semantic call)"]
    LLMJudge -->|APPROVED| ExtractLesson{"Extract cognition\nlesson if applicable"}
    LLMJudge -->|BLOCKED| ExtractLesson2["Extract cognition lesson\ngatilho + anti-padrao + padrao"]
    ExtractLesson2 --> UserFix3{"User decides:\nfix, skip, or abort?"}
    UserFix3 -->|fix| Implementer
  end

  ExtractLesson --> Sanitizer["sanitizing-text"]
  Sanitizer --> UserApprove3{"User approves?"}
  UserApprove3 -->|yes| GitCommitter["committing-changes"]
  UserApprove3 -->|no| Implementer

  style StyleGate1 fill:#4caf50,color:#fff
  style StyleGate2 fill:#4caf50,color:#fff
  style LLMJudge fill:#2196f3,color:#fff
